WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.372
Namaste. Is video mein hum The Ray ko Salon aur Spa ke liye step by step use karenge.

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:09.371
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:09.371 --> 00:00:21.891
Salon mein do cheezein sabse zyada matter karti hain: appointment ka time, aur kaun se stylist ne kitna kaam kiya, kyunki wahi unki kamai aur commission tay karta hai.

00:00:22.217 --> 00:00:25.235
Ye Appointments screen hai, aaj ka schedule.

00:00:25.235 --> 00:00:30.449
Har appointment mein samay, service, customer, aur kaun stylist kaam karega.

00:00:30.449 --> 00:00:38.818
Neeche buttons: Mark arrived jab customer aa jaye, Mark completed jab kaam ho jaye, No-show agar aaya hi nahi, aur Cancel.

00:00:38.818 --> 00:00:43.894
Confirm on WhatsApp se customer ko ek tap mein confirmation message. Kyun?

00:00:43.894 --> 00:00:49.588
Kyunki no-show salon ka sabse bada nuksan hai, aur confirmation se wo kam hota hai.

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:52.608
Naya appointment. Book dabate hain.

00:00:52.608 --> 00:01:00.974
Customer ka naam aur mobile, service chunte hain, jaise Haircut Women, stylist ka naam Sana, tareekh aur samay.

00:01:00.974 --> 00:01:08.661
Kyun? Kyunki appointment bina likhe sirf yaad par chalti hai, aur yaad kabhi na kabhi dhokha deti hai.

00:01:24.689 --> 00:01:30.917
Customer aa gaya to us appointment par Mark arrived dabate hain. Ab sabko dikhta hai ki wo salon mein hai.

00:01:30.917 --> 00:01:35.500
Ye chhoti si baat reception aur stylist ke beech ka phone call bacha deti hai.

00:01:35.883 --> 00:01:43.503
Ab bill. Sell par Divya Chavan ko chunte hain, aur services jodte hain: Haircut Men aur Head Massage.

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:50.294
Services ke saath products bhi bech sakte ho, jaise shampoo ya beard oil, ek hi bill mein.

00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:58.244
Complete bill dabate hi payment screen par ek khaas sawal: Who performed the service, yaani kaam kisne kiya.

00:01:58.244 --> 00:01:59.858
Ravi likhte hain. Kyun?

00:01:59.858 --> 00:02:07.717
Kyunki isi se Staff wise revenue report banti hai, aur stylist ka hisaab ya commission bina jhagde tay hota hai.

00:02:08.096 --> 00:02:14.592
Bill ban gaya. Ravi ka naam is bill se jud gaya, aur ye amount ab uski kamai mein gina jayega.

00:02:14.592 --> 00:02:21.227
Invoice A four, ya chhote thermal receipt par nikal sakte hain, ya WhatsApp par bhej sakte hain.

00:02:21.595 --> 00:02:25.710
Customers. Salon mein repeat customer sabse bada asset hai.

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:31.428
Kisi customer ko kholo to uski saari visits aur bills ki history dikhti hai. Kyun?

00:02:31.428 --> 00:02:40.006
Kyunki pata hota hai ki pichli baar usne kya karwaya tha, aur kab se nahi aaya, to ek message se wapas bulaya ja sakta hai.

00:02:48.263 --> 00:02:54.854
Online booking settings. Yahan ek link hai jo aap customers ko WhatsApp par ya Instagram par bhej sakte ho.

00:02:54.854 --> 00:02:59.104
Customer us link se khud slot chun kar appointment book kar leta hai.

00:02:59.104 --> 00:03:04.956
Neeche appointments ke beech ka gap, har din ke kaam ke ghante, aur chhutti ki tareekhen. Kyun?

00:03:04.956 --> 00:03:09.514
Kyunki raat mein bhi booking mil jaati hai, jab aap phone nahi utha sakte.

00:03:10.561 --> 00:03:17.624
Staff wise revenue. Is mahine har stylist ne kitne bill kiye aur kitna kamaya. Ravi sabse aage hai.

00:03:17.624 --> 00:03:20.049
Upar tareekh badal sakte ho. Kyun?

00:03:20.049 --> 00:03:29.252
Kyunki isi se pata chalta hai kaun sabse zyada kaam kar raha hai, aur salary ya commission ka hisaab ek minute mein ban jata hai.

00:03:29.636 --> 00:03:37.887
Aur Dashboard, roz ka haal: aaj ki sales, kitne appointment, kitna udhaar aur kaun se customer wapas nahi aaye.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:51.143
Aaj humne Salon ka flow dekha: appointment book karna, customer ka arrived aur completed mark karna, service bill mein stylist ka naam, customer history, online booking link, aur staff wise revenue.

00:03:51.143 --> 00:03:55.640
Ek practical baat: har bill par kaam karne wale ka naam zaroor likho.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:59.811
Wahi mahine ke end mein commission ki bahes khatam kar deta hai.
